flowchart LR
  actor["Contributor or agent"]:::person
  workflow["Workflow skill<br/>[Markdown: skills/workflow/SKILL.md]"]:::container
  stage_skills["Stage-owning skills and formal reviewers<br/>[Markdown workflow components]"]:::container
  lifecycle["Lifecycle artifacts and reviews<br/>[Markdown and YAML]"]:::container
  plan["Active plan Current Handoff Summary<br/>[Markdown live-state owner]"]:::container
  evidence["Change-local evidence<br/>[YAML: change.yaml#workflow.automation]"]:::container

  subgraph automation["Automation tooling<br/>[Python: scripts/workflow_automation*.py]"]
    adapter["Command and compatibility adapter"]:::component
    position["Target binder and canonical position resolver"]:::component
    coordinator["Transition coordinator"]:::component
    policy["Typed stage-policy registry"]:::component
    authority["Authorization and capability evaluator"]:::component
    code_state["Canonical code-state provider"]:::component
    state["State store adapter"]:::component
    reconcile["Transition reconciler"]:::component
    compatibility["Legacy compatibility projector"]:::component
    validator["Automation validator"]:::component
  end

  actor -->|starts, resumes, queries, or cancels through| workflow
  workflow -->|invokes normalized command| adapter
  adapter -->|normalizes current and legacy forms with| compatibility
  adapter -->|requests target and position| position
  position -->|derives pre-plan position from| lifecycle
  position -->|reads post-plan position from| plan
  adapter -->|submits structured target to| coordinator
  coordinator -->|selects complete immutable policy from| policy
  coordinator -->|requests executable authority from| authority
  authority -->|checks basis against| lifecycle
  authority -->|checks scope against| policy
  authority -->|requires complete final-code identity from| code_state
  code_state -->|derives reviewed diff and current worktree state from| lifecycle
  coordinator -->|persists through sole write boundary| state
  state -->|reads and writes| evidence
  coordinator -->|reconciles prepared transition through| reconcile
  reconcile -->|reads original effective capability and completion evidence from| evidence
  coordinator -->|invokes one stage operation through| stage_skills
  stage_skills -->|write stage-owned evidence to| lifecycle
  validator -->|checks complete policies in| policy
  validator -->|checks automation state through| state
  validator -->|checks canonical evidence in| lifecycle
  validator -->|checks active-plan synchronization in| plan

  classDef person fill:#08427b,stroke:#073b6f,color:#fff
  classDef system fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0e5aa7,color:#fff
  classDef external fill:#999,stroke:#666,color:#fff
  classDef container fill:#438dd5,stroke:#3c7fc0,color:#fff
  classDef component fill:#85bbf0,stroke:#3c7fc0,color:#111
